00:01:50.497 --> 00:01:51.786
100-millionaire.

00:01:51.786 --> 00:01:53.167
Maybe with my assets, you know,

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:54.607
VaynerMedia and Wine
Library are doing well,

00:01:54.607 --> 00:01:57.730
but I splurge on experiences.

00:01:57.730 --> 00:02:02.024
For example, LeBron's first
game back in Cleveland

00:02:02.024 --> 00:02:03.592
against my Knicks, as you notice today

00:02:03.592 --> 00:02:05.693
I'm wearing orange because I'm starting to

00:02:05.693 --> 00:02:07.794
get ready for the basketball season.

00:02:07.794 --> 00:02:09.965
You can imagine why.

00:02:09.965 --> 00:02:11.208
So, experiences.

00:02:11.208 --> 00:02:13.646
You know, vacations with my family,

00:02:13.646 --> 00:02:17.174
and definitely things
like LeBron's first game

00:02:17.174 --> 00:02:19.729
back in Cleveland, and
they play the Knicks.

00:02:19.729 --> 00:02:22.666
AJ's a huge Knicks fan,
more so than even I am.

00:02:22.666 --> 00:02:24.105
Let's go with him to that.

00:02:24.105 --> 00:02:25.312
Something me and my bro can remember

00:02:25.312 --> 00:02:26.729
when we're much older.

00:02:26.729 --> 00:02:28.551
It's cool to like, sit
around if you're an old man

00:02:28.551 --> 00:02:29.887
and be like, "Remember when we went to

00:02:29.887 --> 00:02:32.092
"Kareem's first game back in Milwaukee?

00:02:32.092 --> 00:02:32.672
"With the Lakers?"

00:02:32.672 --> 00:02:33.752
That's like a fun story.

00:02:33.752 --> 00:02:34.925
Those are the kind of
things, I want to spend

00:02:34.925 --> 00:02:37.054
money on experiences.

00:02:37.054 --> 00:02:40.393
Paying for my friends to go
on trips when I was younger,

00:02:40.393 --> 00:02:42.099
when they couldn't afford it.

00:02:42.099 --> 00:02:44.536
I splurge on spending time with people

00:02:44.536 --> 00:02:46.057
that I care about.

00:02:46.057 --> 00:02:47.056
- Hey Gary.

