00:03:40.981 --> 00:03:43.558
So behind the scenes
videos, doing good stories,

00:03:43.558 --> 00:03:45.717
I would definitely draw
on top of pictures,

00:03:45.717 --> 00:03:46.878
I would take pictures of the players

00:03:46.878 --> 00:03:49.444
